かればslacklogのURLは一意に定まる感じですか?(もしかしてそのあたり処理してくれる関数ある?)","ts":"1621612465.085400","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1621612505.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xD6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79aed2c4-0e3f-4b05-9214-9f002d61fec3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"誤差でしょうねー","ts":"1621612345.083900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UZTwu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4d6d65e-9e30-4253-812f-5c4d09a888f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あと一応ホストするファイルのサイズは減らせると思う。まあ files の比率がでかすぎるのでこれはたぶん誤差","ts":"1621612326.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Y/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9053d314-af96-4b91-bfc1-fe1819ad529e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、JS で生成の方が見た目良くなりそうではある","ts":"1621612300.082800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef1ca6b4-cc2b-4401-992f-edb7c6498e34","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もちろんGo製の部分を移植することになるだろうし死ぬわけではない","ts":"1621612299.082700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=IU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b6f3f0a-059e-46a6-820e-1a5e7a45606c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"十分役に立ってるので無駄だったってことはないですよ","ts":"1621612286.082300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1IW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45cba929-26e2-49ab-b2a8-c80d5161a549","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"将来的にはフロントエンド入れたいみたいな話もありましたよね","ts":"1621612276.081900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pq=1K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecc3d92b-7aca-4be0-8f30-f629a071c453","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"頑張ったのに…","ts":"1621612258.081500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dNBc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4dfcb09-eac4-46cb-94ca-3840943373f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"などと考えていくと、なんかこうサーバには JSON だけホストしてページの構築は JS でやるのがいいんじゃないかと言う気持ちになってくる。ちなみにそうなると Go 製の html 生成部分は不要になりそう","ts":"1621612226.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022BN6SZB6"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2yEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16311ee2-d7e6-49d4-914f-d46a3f1c1534","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あと今、ページを1ヶ月単位で切ってるけど、流速が速いチャンネルだとそれだとでかすぎてページを開ききるまでにだいぶ時間がかかる。そして開ききらないと `#` ページ内リンクに飛んでくれない。つらい。遅延して読んでほしい","ts":"1621612141.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VJwTS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40d738f1-423f-4861-9507-bd200cffaffc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"でも1ファイル辺りが割とでかいし厳しそう","ts":"1621612140.079900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84c6143e-8001-4adc-b5a0-f3ae62245ffa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"後はhtmlに不可視のタグを仕込んで分解するとか？","ts":"1621612130.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UyW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b72c223-a031-4bc2-b27f-fe1c067d711f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"検索プレビューやるためにはサーバ側に会話ログの JSON を置いといて必要な時にそいつらを引っ張ってきて画面に出すってことをやる必要があるはず。そうすると JSON データと html に変換済みの会話データでデータがかぶる。無駄。","ts":"1621612043.078300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kjjx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7553e0d-8304-4365-9d51-bf2aa07a54ec","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"あーそうかページのHTMLを生成してるのはGo側で静的にやってるからJSから動的には作れないのかなるほど","ts":"1621612039.078100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hpl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ac750de-46f8-4746-a6f3-eeebaa319849","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一時期話に出てた SPA にするか? みたいな話になってくる","ts":"1621611974.076100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l0A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d5f9412-14d5-420c-b76b-dfe78ae22ad7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それやるならReactとか挟みたいみたいな気持ちとビルドしたくないという気持ちと両方ある","ts":"1621611968.075900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QlAcG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68471081-f7fc-4de4-84d8-555ca277678d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"（検索結果プレビューまじでほしい）","ts":"1621611955.075300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v3Zvm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"686d64fd-8e80-4242-b901-46dba238ac2c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"検索結果でプレビュー出すの、JSON データから JS で発言の DOM を構築する必要があって、なんかそれやるなら通常のログのページも JSON から構築するようにするとロジック使い回せるのではって思うけどそこまで行くと大工事なんだよな。全体を再設計するレベルになる","ts":"1621611924.074700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bpy4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ec121d4-5e01-4a52-b8a6-9efd813b0d8a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うわけでコントリビュータはいつでも大募集なのでどんどん改善してほしい","ts":"1621611810.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"15a=3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e844a2e1-3598-4255-8d03-208b232441f1","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ひぇ…なかなか大変なことをやってた","ts":"1621611675.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j+DJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e4b437d-1396-4f90-a3a0-a172f5d87d84","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみにスレッドの中身はそれでは取れなくて別 API で取る必要がある","ts":"1621611596.072300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qa="}]},{"client_msg_id":"596c2ff3-3d5b-4140-b7c2-810f18533e41","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それ","ts":"1621611579.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ccb5ef1-cfbd-4173-bf80-47bf854efc00","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://api.slack.com/methods/conversations.history|https://api.slack.com/methods/conversations.history\u003e\nこれかな","ts":"1621611461.071500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Slack: conversations.history Slack API Method","id":1,"title":"conversations.history Slack API Method","title_link":"https://api.slack.com/methods/conversations.history","text":"Fetches a conversation's history of messages and events.","thumb_url":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/api_200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Slack","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/marketing/img/meta/favicon-32.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://api.slack.com/methods/conversations.history","original_url":"https://api.slack.com/methods/conversations.history"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iFP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb158748-5b5b-4ea0-bf7f-a8e22414b4cc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実は現状、前日以前の発言にスレッドで返事をしてもログに反映されません。","ts":"1621611255.071400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7YI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aafba610-9126-40aa-9c9a-1d4c3db6c354","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"このデイリー取得も実は穴があって発言が抜けたりするので、完全には無理でももうちょい改善したいところ…","ts":"1621611211.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","re